  "note": "Election of five members of Portrush Urban District Council on 15 January 1931; nine candidates for five seats after the withdrawal of Mrs. Annie Hamilton King. Ten were nominated and one (Mrs. Annie Hamilton King) withdrew. M'Keown, Stewart, Black and Adams were retiring members."
